{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `Y`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: reordered the model block so that each parameter receives its built-in prior before any model-block use in the nonlinear mean or likelihood. The likelihood `Y ~ normal(m, sigma)` is unchanged and remains the single observation of the protected top-level data variable `Y`. Context inputs `N` and `x` are not protected because they are sizes/predictors and are not scored as observations. No data changes were required.
","model_safe_stan":"data {
  int<lower=0> N;
  array[N] real x;
  array[N] real Y;
}
parameters {
  real alpha;
  real beta;
  real<lower=.5, upper=1> lambda; // orginal gamma in the JAGS example  
  real<lower=0> tau;
}
transformed parameters {
  real sigma;
  real U3;
  sigma = 1 / sqrt(tau);
  U3 = logit(lambda);
}
model {
  array[N] real m;

  alpha ~ normal(0.0, 1000);
  beta ~ normal(0.0, 1000);
  lambda ~ uniform(.5, 1);
  tau ~ gamma(.0001, .0001);

  for (i in 1 : N) {
    m[i] = alpha - beta * pow(lambda, x[i]);
  }
  Y ~ normal(m, sigma);
}
","data_safe_json":"{"N":2,"Y":[4.364871468049579,2.1172530627324466],"x":[5.799125181219118,4.119166089023296]}","protected_variables":["Y"]}
